  "description": "The Public Key Infrastructure (PKI) Core contains fundamental packages required by Rocky Enterprise Software Foundation Certificate System.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* pki-core: Dogtag/PKI: certprofile-import allows code execution via unsanitized profile content (ExternalProcessConstraint) (CVE-2026-76561)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
